Subject: [PATCH] Add debug auto repro for Ultimate Rampage terminal victory crash. Used with Fix_infinite_dungeon_victory_null_renderer_crash.patch

On the first completed Ultimate Rampage floor, replace the normal floor-ending
popup with the terminal dungeon-victory GUI path.

Modes are selected with DEBUG_ULTIMATE_VICTORY_REPRO_MODE:
- OFF: normal game behavior.
- VERIFY_FIX: run the terminal path through the null guard.
- ORIGINAL_CRASH: bypass the guard to reproduce the original crash (default).

This calls only the GUI path, avoiding completion metrics and Steam achievement
side effects while preserving the failing FloorEndingGui control flow.
---
